{{Term/Store|Mighty Carp|Mighty Carp|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Mighty Carp}}
Mighty Carp can be found swimming in the [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] of the [[Akkala Highlands]] and [[Lanayru Great Spring]]. There is a compound in its liver that promotes muscle growth.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Like other carps, they can be exposed to [[Fire]] to become [[Roasted Carp]]s or chilled by [[Ice]] to become [[Frozen Carp]]s. [[Link]] can eat one to restore a single [[Heart]], but they can also be [[Cooking|Cooked]] into a [[Meal]]h that will grant Link the [[Attack Up]] [[Added Effect]] when eaten.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

